ans certain security features like password reset URLs are not as secure as they should be. Instead, only a slow, less-secure fallback generator is available. See the <a href=":drupal-php">system requirements</a> page for more information. %exception_message','','none');
INSERT INTO `locales_source` VALUES ('6909','Less secure','','none'),('6910','Detailed cron logging','','none'),('6911','Visitors will only see the maintenance mode message. Only users with the "@permission-label" <a href=":permissions-url">permission</a> will be able to access the site. Authorized users can log in directly via the <a href=":user-login">user login</a> page.','','none'),('6912','Initial visibility level','','11.3.3'),('6913','Number of levels to display','','11.3.3'),('6914','This maximum number includes the initial level.','','11.3.3'),('6915','Base default argument','','none'),('6916','Filter by view name, machine name, description, or display path','','11.3.3'),('6917','Enter a part of the view name, machine name, description, or display path to filter by.','','11.3.3'),('6918','Configure workflows.','','none'),('6919','Create and edit workflows.','','none'),('6920','Edit state','','none'),('6921','Edit transition','','none'),('6922','From state IDs','','none'),('6923','From state ID','','none'),('6924','To state ID','','none'),('6925','Created the %label Workflow. In order for the workflow to be enabled there needs to be at least one state.','','none'),('6926','Workflow %label deleted.','','none'),('6927','There are no states yet.','','none'),('6928','This workflow has no states and will be disabled until there is at least one, <a href=":add-state">add a new state.</a>','','none'),('6929','Add a new state','','none'),('6930','There are no transitions yet.','','none'),('6931','Add a new transition','','none'),('6932','Saved the %label Workflow.','','none'),('6933','Created %label state.','','none'),('6934','Are you sure you want to delete %state from %workflow?','','none'),('6935','State %label deleted.','','none'),('6936','Saved %label state.','','none'),('6937','The transition from %from to %to already exists.','','none'),('6938','Created %label transition.','','none');
